Description: An analysis pipeline to get differential abundance of metabolites
             from metabolomics data with limma. Provides functions for QC with PCA, blank
             filtering and selecting the best available extraction method for each
             metabolite. Model fitting is done with limma and results may be plotted as volcano plots.
